      en: ["Casamance receives between 1000 and 1500 mm of rainfall annually.", "Rice farming is frequently organized through communal village structures.", "The Kayendo is a traditional Diola spade used for preparing the soil.", "Freshwater rice cultivation takes place in the lower-lying inland valleys.", "The region contributes substantially to national rice production goals.", "Harvest festivals are central social events within Diola communities."],
