      en: ["Djoudj is the third largest bird sanctuary in the world.", "The park was officially established in 1971.", "It hosts the world's largest colony of great white pelicans.", "Approximately 350 different bird species have been recorded here.", "The optimal time for visiting is between November and April.", "The sanctuary is located about 60 kilometers north of Saint-Louis."],
